WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:21.606
The king scratched his belly.

2
00:00:21.606 --> 00:00:26.145
"Something's making me itch!" he said.

3
00:00:26.145 --> 00:00:28.501
The queen looked up from her book.

4
00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:33.864
"Take a bath," she said.

5
00:00:33.865 --> 00:00:36.941
The queen scratched her arm.

6
00:00:36.941 --> 00:00:40.757
"I'm itchy too," Prince Eric said.

7
00:00:40.757 --> 00:00:44.354
He scratched and then peeked down his shirt.

8
00:00:44.354 --> 00:00:47.482
"Ack! I see bugs!"

9
00:00:47.483 --> 00:00:50.885
"Bugs?" Princess Mary cried.

10
00:00:50.885 --> 00:00:53.730
She tried to scratch her back.

11
00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:56.533
"Tom!" the princess cried.

12
00:00:56.533 --> 00:01:01.162
"Make the bugs go away!"

13
00:01:01.162 --> 00:01:03.314
Tom lifted his wand.

14
00:01:03.314 --> 00:01:05.149
He looked worried.

15
00:01:05.149 --> 00:01:08.371
"What kind of bugs?" he asked.

16
00:01:08.371 --> 00:01:11.437
"I can't see them."

17
00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:13.856
The queen looked at the princess.

18
00:01:13.857 --> 00:01:22.511
"You have fleas!" she cried.

19
00:01:22.511 --> 00:01:26.701
Everybody but Tom was scratching.

20
00:01:26.701 --> 00:01:30.274
Cat hissed at Tom.

21
00:01:30.275 --> 00:01:33.236
"I don't want fleas!" she said.

22
00:01:33.237 --> 00:01:35.223
"Let's get out of here!"

23
00:01:35.223 --> 00:01:37.651
Tom looked at Princess Mary.

24
00:01:37.651 --> 00:01:41.460
She was still scratching flea bites.

25
00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:45.056
"Cat, you can go to our room," he said.

26
00:01:45.057 --> 00:01:46.777
"I'll stay and help."

27
00:01:46.777 --> 00:01:49.639
Cat sighed.

28
00:01:49.639 --> 00:01:52.228
"You have a kind heart, Tom."

29
00:01:52.228 --> 00:01:55.707
She hid deep in his pocket.

30
00:01:55.707 --> 00:01:59.252
"Where did the fleas come from?" Tom asked.

31
00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:01.269
He waved his wand.

32
00:02:01.269 --> 00:02:03.060
"I'll send them back."

33
00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.282
"It's your fault!" Dirk yelled.

34
00:02:06.282 --> 00:02:08.698
Dirk pointed at Tom's pocket.

35
00:02:08.698 --> 00:02:11.336
"Fleas come from animals.

36
00:02:11.336 --> 00:02:14.802
Your cat brought fleas to the castle!

37
00:02:14.802 --> 00:02:20.278
She must go!"
